                                                "sense_id": "b440e880-f1c0-3a82-8515-bd9335c6bb93",
                                                "text": "Do you like cocoa?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4756e27a-73b5-4984-8857-3593a32d4434",
                                                "sense_id": "b440e880-f1c0-3a82-8515-bd9335c6bb93",
                                                "text": "Half past nine - high time for supper;\nCocoa, love? Of course, my dear.\nHelen thinks it quite delicious,\nJohn prefers it now to beer....\n¶For they've stumbled on the secret\nOf a love that never wanes,\nRapt beneath the tumbled bedclothes,\nCocoa coursing through their veins."
                                            }
